# A Length of 0 for a straight line is refused, and the field has to show the
# line's length again. It was refilled from the curve fields of the segment,
# which for a line hold its end points (Development Issues #75). Field 6 is
# Length: each end point counts as two fields, X then Y, then Angle.
VERSION 13
DEMOINIT
ORIG 0.000 0.000 0.000
ROOMSIZE 40.000 x 20.000
SCALE HO
DRAW 1 0 0 0 0 0.000000 0.000000 0 0.000000
	L3 0 0.000000 5.000000 10.000000 0 15.000000 10.000000 0
	END$SEGS
REDRAW
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 10.000 10.000
MOUSE 4 10.000 10.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Straight Line 6 10.000
PARAMETER Describe Straight Line 6 0.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Straight Line 6 10.000
PARAMETER Describe Straight Line cancel
COMMAND Describe
MOUSE 2 10.000 10.000
MOUSE 4 10.000 10.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Straight Line 3 15.000
PARAMCHECK Describe Straight Line 6 10.000
PARAMETER Describe Straight Line cancel
